From 2623738557360cf87d9dd67212a47046a3de28d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:49:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: respect kTaggedPointer in SimplifiedLowering (2a154b5db9,
 crbug 585624825)

V8 15.6 merge 2a154b5db9 (15.6.75.88; cherry-pick of main 33cdb11f68).
TruncatingUseInfoFromRepresentation returned AnyTagged for kTaggedPointer,
so a scalar-replaced PropertyArray could get a Smi stored into a
HeapObject slot. Use TaggedPointer and add ChangeTaggedToTaggedPointer to
box Smis into HeapNumbers without deoptimizing.
